+## Tasks & Acceptance
+
+**Execution:**
+- [ ] `server/src/application/form_copy.gleam` -- replace checklist item 3 constant, 3 trigger notes, and all 22 em-dash constants; `draft_prep_note` becomes item-6 copy -- user-ruled copy + ban
+- [ ] `server/src/application/form_view.gleam` -- 6-item prep list, remove prep-note paragraph, de-dash intro/title -- checklist verbatim + ban
+- [ ] `server/src/notification/email_client.gleam` -- 6-item checklist (entity-encoded), drop trailing one-visit paragraph, de-dash all template strings + subjects -- checklist verbatim + ban
+- [ ] `server/priv/static/form_draft.js` + `form_stepper.js` -- sync mirrored strings, remove PREP_NOTE_SAVE swap -- keep-in-sync doctrine
+- [ ] Remaining server files (error_summary, form_pages, application_handler, form_sections/*, document_*, draft_view, copy.gleam, consent/account/auth/payment/erasure/response_helpers, legal/**, content/*, ai evidence/audit) -- sweep every user-facing `—`/`\u{2014}`/`&mdash;` -- global ban
+- [ ] `client/src/**` -- sweep copy.gleam, client.gleam, pages, components (incl. `"—"` placeholders → `"-"`) -- global ban
+- [ ] `shared/src/shared/policy_highlights.gleam` -- 1 string -- global ban
+- [ ] `server/test/**` + `client/test/**` -- update copy assertions -- tests green
+- [ ] `.pi/skills/*/scenarios/**` -- update E2E assertions on changed strings -- scenarios stay valid
+- [ ] Commit, push `form-copy-revision`, PR to `develop` with Decisions & rationale -- delivery
+
+**Acceptance Criteria:**
+- Given the /apply form, when rendered without JS, then the prep block lists exactly the user's 6 items verbatim and no prep-note paragraph follows.
+- Given the invite/auto-reply/reminder emails, when sent, then the checklist block contains the same 6 items verbatim and no em-dash in any template.
+- Given a student/never-rented/unemployed applicant, when the trigger choice is made, then the ahead-note shows the exact student copy or its same-shape sibling, em-dash-free.
+- Given `rg` over user-facing copy (all of server/src, client/src, priv/static JS), when scanning for `—`, `\u{2014}`, and `&mdash;`, then zero hits remain; every surviving literal em-dash sits in a comment or log string (listed in the PR).
+- Given `make format && make test && make build`, then all three pass.
+- Given the PR, when opened, then it carries a Decisions & rationale section and is never merged by the agent.
+
+## Verification
+
+**Commands:**
+- `make format && make test && make build` -- all green
+- `rg -n '\\u\{2014\}|&mdash;' server/src client/src server/priv/static shared/src --glob '*.{gleam,js}'` -- every hit is a comment/log, justified in PR
+- `rg -n '—' server/src client/src --glob '*.gleam' | sed 's/^[^:]*:[0-9]*://' | rg -v '^\s*//' | rg '"'` -- remaining hits are logs only
+- `git diff --stat` -- expected: copy files only, no SQL/API/schema churn
